# Laravel — Project Conventions

This is the **Laravel 13** backend in the Tripteki parallel-codebase family. It is a **modular monolith** (REST only, no GraphQL) sharing the same API contract with NestJS and FastAPI.

## Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Framework | Laravel 13 + PHP 8.3 |
| Server | **Laravel Octane** (dev and production) |
| Architecture | Modular monolith via `nwidart/laravel-modules` |
| Auth | `tymon/jwt-auth` — `ACCESS_TOKEN` / `REFRESH_TOKEN` scopes |
| DTOs | Spatie Laravel Data |
| Permissions | Spatie Permission + custom `Gate::before` for superadmin |
| Query | Spatie Query Builder (filtering, sorting) |
| Activity log | Spatie Activitylog |
| Excel | maatwebsite/excel (import/export) |
| Broadcast | Laravel Reverb + Echo (private channels) |
| Web Push | optional VAPID |
| Queue | Redis |
| Database | MySQL (production); SQLite in-memory (tests) |

## Directory layout

```
app/                            # Laravel application shell
  Console/, Exceptions/, Helpers/, Providers/, Http/
routes/
  api.php                       # Root API route file
src/                            # Domain modules
  Auth/                         # Authentication module
  User/                         # User management module
  Notification/                 # Notifications module
  Acl/                          # Access control module
  Log/                          # Activity logging module
  I18N/                         # Internationalization module
database/seeders/
lang/                           # Root translations
tests/                          # Root test helpers
  AuthenticatesWithJwt.php
  TestCase.php
```

### Per-module structure

```
src/{Module}/
  app/
    Http/Controllers/
    Services/
    Repositories/
    Dtos/
    Events/
    Listeners/
    Jobs/
    Imports/                    # Excel import classes
    Exports/                    # Excel export classes
  routes/                       # Module route definitions
  Database/
    Migrations/
    Seeders/
  lang/{en,ms,id}/              # Module translations
  tests/Feature/                # Module feature tests
  composer.json                 # Module-specific dependencies
```

## Naming conventions

| Artifact | Convention | Example |
|----------|-----------|---------|
| Controller | PascalCase + Controller | `UserAdminController` |
| Service | PascalCase + Service | `UserAdminService` |
| DTO | PascalCase + Dto | `UserDto` |
| Test | PascalCase + Test | `UserAdminTest` |
| Namespace | `Modules\{Module}\App\{Layer}` | `Modules\User\App\Http\Controllers` |

## Shared API contract (all backends)

### Endpoints
- REST base: `/api/v1`
- OpenAPI docs via PHP 8 attributes: `#[OA\Get(...)]`, `#[OA\Post(...)]`
- Use `OpenApiDocument` helper for consistent document structure

### Auth
- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` — `{ access_token, refresh_token, token_type, expires_in }`
- `POST /api/v1/auth/refresh`, `POST /api/v1/auth/register`, `POST /api/v1/auth/logout`
- `GET /api/v1/auth/profile`
- Swagger tag for auth endpoints: **`UserAuth`** (not `Auth`)

### Error responses
```json
// Validation (HTTP 422) — FastAPI-style, NOT Laravel default
{ "detail": [{ "loc": ["body", "email"], "msg": "...", "type": "..." }] }

// General
{ "message": "Human-readable error" }
```

### Pagination
```json
{ "data": [...], "meta": { "total", "per_page", "current_page", "last_page" }, "links": { "first", "last", "prev", "next" } }
```

### Rate limiting
- Named limiters: `api-read` (10/min), `api-write` (30/min), `api-refresh`, `api-register`
- Applied in **production only**

## Auth & ACL

- `Gate::before` grants all permissions to `superadmin` role
- Permission checks on admin routes via middleware
- Default superuser: `superuser@{APP_EMAIL_SERVER}` / `12345678`

## Environment variables

```
APP_KEY, APP_URL, APP_ENV, APP_DEBUG, APP_EMAIL_SERVER
JWT_SECRET
OCTANE_HOST, OCTANE_PORT
DB_CONNECTION, DB_HOST, DB_PORT, DB_DATABASE, DB_USERNAME, DB_PASSWORD
MM_REDIS_HOST, MM_REDIS_PORT, MM_REDIS_PASSWORD    # Redis
QUEUE_CONNECTION
BROADCAST_CONNECTION=log|reverb
REVERB_APP_ID, REVERB_APP_KEY, REVERB_APP_SECRET, REVERB_HOST, REVERB_PORT
VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY, VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY, VAPID_SUBJECT
MAIL_DRIVER, MAIL_ADMIN_NAME, MAIL_ADMIN_EMAIL
FILESYSTEM_DISK=private
```

## Required processes

Laravel Octane alone is not sufficient — run these concurrently:

```bash
php artisan octane:start          # HTTP server
php artisan queue:work              # Background jobs (import/export)
php artisan schedule:work           # Scheduled tasks
```

## Module management

- Each module has its own `composer.json`
- Dependencies merged via `wikimedia/composer-merge-plugin`
- To add a new module: follow existing `src/{Module}/` structure

## Testing

```bash
composer test     # PHPUnit Feature suite (SQLite in-memory)
composer lint     # Laravel Pint
```

- `phpunit.xml` sets `DB_CONNECTION=sqlite`, `DB_DATABASE=:memory:`
- Test helpers: `AuthenticatesWithJwt` trait for JWT-authenticated requests
- Tests discovered in `./src` and `./tests` (`*Test.php`)

## Lint

```bash
composer lint     # Laravel Pint (code style fixer)
```
